描いていただけないでしょうか？\nデザインや構図はお任せしますが本の題名や作家名などを空いている部分などに入れるので余白を作って下さるか、どこか字か載っていても大丈夫な部分があると助かります。\nよかったらご検討ください！", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mayakashikanata/works/15", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/18e78e98/uploads/origins/097166f8-64c1-4f11-bf30-cd86a4126130?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fb020d0f20224719ad63a8658aef0bd1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/18e78e98/uploads/origins/097166f8-64c1-4f11-bf30-cd86a4126130?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fb020d0f20224719ad63a8658aef0bd1, https://si.imgix.net/18e78e98/uploads/origins/097166f8-64c1-4f11-bf30-cd86a4126130?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=53b3f99b64b19e9c2110925985888d51 2x, https://si.imgix.net/18e78e98/uploads/origins/097166f8-64c1-4f11-bf30-cd86a4126130?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=421aa5badc7628def8330bb579e0d20f 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2555743, "nc": 32}, {"path": "/@mayakashikanata/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b39ab7f4/uploads/origins/417346f3-8299-4375-ba3b-b71e9fd35bf3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a7fa3c7c4c2940c472ca58fc20c42283", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b39ab7f4/uploads/origins/417346f3-8299-4375-ba3b-b71e9fd35bf3?bg=%23fff&au